{
  "name": "Contact Finder to Email Verifier Pipeline (Find → Verify → Keep Deliverable)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Contact Finder to Verifier Chain\n\nScrapes contact emails for a list of company domains, then immediately chains them into the Email Verifier Actor to confirm mailboxes exist. Only keeps deliverable addresses for cold outreach.\n\n## Setup (once)\n\n**1. Get an Apify token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. Create the n8n credential**\nCredentials → New → **Header Auth**\n- Name: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\nEvery HTTP node here points at that credential by name. No token is stored in this file.\n\n## Why chain with verification\nContact scrapers find mailto links and text patterns, but some inboxes are defunct. Chaining verification drops invalid syntax and dead mailboxes before they hit your sending domain.\n\n## Cost\n\nPay-per-event: $0.006 per domain where a contact (email or phone) is found (down to $0.003 on Gold tier, from $3.00 per 1,000). Blocked, unreachable, and zero-contact domains are completely free.\n\nCurrent pricing: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder/pricing\n\nActor: https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder\nTemplates & docs: https://github.com/sumitrmardy/website-contact-finder-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t3-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "t3-trigger-manual",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c993763f-d01a-4416-9520-354af6038de0",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "mud-dock.co.uk",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t3-trigger",
      "name": "Domains input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~website-contact-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: [ $json.domain ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "t3-find",
      "name": "Find contacts (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const emails = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  for (const e of item.json.emails || []) {\n    if (e.email) emails.push(e.email);\n  }\n}\nif (emails.length === 0) return [];\nreturn [{\n  json: { emails }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "t3-extract-emails",
      "name": "Extract found email list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~email-verifier/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ emails: $json.emails }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "t3-verify",
      "name": "Verify emails (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "ad2b18a1-c610-480e-b4aa-d3f838a4904b",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "deliverable",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t3-filter-deliverable",
      "name": "Filter deliverable leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
